# Code style (Swift)

- Prefer clear names over abbreviations except established math (`mu`, `tau`,
  `sigma`) documented next to research constants.
- Keep functions focused; extract helpers before hitting SwiftLint
  `function_body_length` error (120).
- Raycast Script Command wrappers stay thin: build/exec only; logic lives in
  the SPM package.
